# Entering this directory gets you Papol's tools and Papol's settings.
#
#   direnv allow
#
# The tools come from flake.nix, which is the only place dependencies are
# listed. `nix develop` gives you the same environment by hand.
use flake

# Local settings and secrets, if there are any. Same shape as the file the
# deployed service loads through systemd (~/.config/papol/secrets.env), so
# there is one format to remember. Not committed, and optional — Papol has
# a working default for everything in it.
dotenv_if_exists .env
